Order Dispatched

A order has been dispatched and is on its way to the customer.

Order Details:
- Order ID: #<%= @order.id.to_s.first(8) %>
- Customer: <%= @order.user.first_name || @order.user.email %>
- Product: <%= @product&.name || "N/A" %>
<% if @warehouse %>- Warehouse: <%= @warehouse.name %><% end %>

Dispatched Items:
<% items_to_show = @fulfillment ? @order_items : @order.order_items.includes(variant_stock: { variant_options: :images }) %>
<% items_to_show.each do |item| %>
- <%= item.variant_stock_option_names || "Item" %>
  Quantity: <%= item.quantity %>
  <% if item.variant_stock_warehouse_name %>Warehouse: <%= item.variant_stock_warehouse_name %><% end %>
<% end %>

View order: <%= @order_url %>

